# Kabla runs completely WITHOUT any API key using the built-in fallback
# (deterministic safety guard + the patient's words preserved verbatim).
#
# To power dynamic answer-processing with Claude, set your Anthropic API key
# below and run the server (npm run dev, or npm run server). The key lives ONLY
# on the server — it is never exposed to the browser.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your key:

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional overrides:
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8
# PORT=8787

# Frontend (optional): force the offline mock provider regardless of the server.
# VITE_AI_PROVIDER=mock
# Frontend (optional): point the browser at a non-same-origin AI server.
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8787
